{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_try_it_console", "label": "Scalar \"Try it\" console", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaced a hand-rolled TryItPanel that did a direct fetch and hit CORS; the lower-level createApiClientModal is used because the React wrapper does not forward plugins and the client does not run x-pre-request scripts."}, {"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_ekosigningplugin", "label": "ekoSigningPlugin (beforeRequest hook)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs after auth schemes populate headers and immediately before the request is built, so deleting access_key is deterministic \u2014 only the derived signature leaves the browser."}, {"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_computesecretkey", "label": "computeSecretKey (Web Crypto HMAC-SHA256)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_tryit_client", "label": "tryit-client.ts (client-only Scalar modal singleton)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Loaded only via a dynamic import inside useTryIt's callback so the Vue app and the 342 KB spec layer stay out of the server module graph and the initial docs bundle."}, {"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_interactive_openapi", "label": "Interactive OpenAPI document ({ interactive: true })", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The public openapi.json stays pristine and byte-stable; only the modal's variant adds apiKey security schemes and drops the signing headers the schemes and plugin supply."}, {"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_cors_proxy", "label": "Try-it CORS proxy (VITE_SCALAR_PROXY_URL)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Honest framing: with the hosted proxy the developer_key, computed secret-key and bodies transit a third party \u2014 acceptable for sandbox traffic, and the raw access_key is never transmitted. Blank the var for zero third-party transit."}, {"id": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_dev_only_creds", "label": "DEV-only credential prefill", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gated by import.meta.env.DEV, which is false during the Node prerender and in production, so credentials never reach static output."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_developer_docs_api_documentation_codesamples", "target": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_try_it_console", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_try_it_console", "target": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_tryit_client", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/developer-docs/try-it-now.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_tryit_client", "target": "docs_developer_docs_try_it_now_ekosigningplugin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "E